    {
      "start": 19.0,
      "end": 24.64,
      "text": "This chart is a direct head-to-head comparison of chat GPT's baseline capabilities in 2023"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.64,
      "end": 31.939999999999998,
      "text": "versus where the models are projecting for 2026. Look at how it answers prompts. In 2023, the AI"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.939999999999998,
      "end": 36.620000000000005,
      "text": "started typing the instant you hit enter, spitting out whatever sequence of words came first."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.260000000000005,
      "end": 42.3,
      "text": "By 2026, it can pause. It will sit quietly and work on a hard problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.4,
      "end": 45.86,
      "text": "sometimes for minutes at a time, before delivering a reasoned response."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.82,
      "end": 51.68,
      "text": "Then there is image generation. Ask an early model for a picture of your dog's spot,"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.0,
      "end": 58.5,
      "text": "and it might return a cute puppy with a bonus leg. Current projections for 2026 include photo"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.5,
      "end": 65.12,
      "text": "real images featuring actual, legible text alongside full generated video with synchronized sound and dialogue."
    }
